    <date day="29" month="October" year="2026"/>
    <abstract>
      <t>This document describes a TCP option that permits network elements to
   provide TCP endpoints advice on rate limits within the network.  The
   functionality for TCP is analogous to SCONE packets within the QUIC
   protocol.</t>
    </abstract>
  </front>
